WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.630
This is ENIAC.

2
00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:05.030
Cables and switches, whole walls of them.

3
00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:10.530
To change its job, a team rewired its
plugboards and reset its switches by hand.

4
00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:12.410
That could take days.

5
00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:13.610
Now your phone.

6
00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:15.650
Game, tap, map.

7
00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:17.570
Not one wire touched.

8
00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:18.810
So what changed?

9
00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:21.210
Does your phone rewire its own chip?

10
00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:23.590
Does it hide a chip for every app?

11
00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:28.730
In this mission, you'll meet the CPU,
which processes a program's instructions.

12
00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:32.410
You'll meet main memory, and
find out what it really holds.

13
00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:36.630
And you'll see why a washing machine
has its own built-in computer.

14
00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:40.590
Your mission: explain why your
phone swaps apps instantly,

15
00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:42.320
when ENIAC took days.
